+| GitHub CI / GameTestServer | **NOT RUN** | No CI runner; no legitimate GameTest implemented |
+| Blender actual export / rendering | **BLOCKED / NOT RUN** | No Owner `.blend` device asset supplied, no new renderer implemented |
